'''The Battle Cats''' is the improved version of the original [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|Battle Cats]] and is available in more than 100 countries (since November 10th, 2014). This version has many features, nearly matching the [[Nyanko Daisensou|current Japanese version]]. However, it is not possible to transfer Japanese data over to this version, as they have different servers.

